    "demon_epithet_pattern": "each opposing power (the Chaotic 13 for a Lawful-leaning realm; the Lawful 12 for a Chaotic one) keeps its morphed name + a hostile portfolio-epithet, distinct per power: Maraksh the Devourer; Lusanto the Coin-Serpent; Tulrish the Blinding Tyrant.",
